  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Igman Resor - 97, A-l&#xE5;n</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Igman Resor - 97, WoL - Travel Agency 1997</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Avskrivning av avskrivningsl&#xE5;n f&#xF6;r genomf&#xF6;rt projekt. Resebyr&#xE5; i Sarajevo. Igman Resor AB beviljades avskrivningsl&#xE5;n p&#xE5; 500 000 SEK f&#xF6;r utbildning i samband med utveckling av resebyr&#xE5;verksamhet (dotterbolag) i Sarajevo. Projektet har genomf&#xF6;rts planenligt och nu avskrivs l&#xE5;net.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Igman Resor AB was granted a write-off loan of 500 000 SEK for training of personnel in order to develop a subsidairy company for travel-agency services in Sarajevo. The projectactivities have been carried out in acoordance to the plans and the loan will be written off.</narrative>
  </description>
